	(text_box "CADENCE Antenna PCB is a 6-layer board supporting UHF communications, GPS L1 reception, power transfer, and antenna deployment.\n\nUHF - 437.5 MHz\n\n- 3 QBA-07+ hybrids generating four phased antenna outputs (0°, 90°, 180°, 270°)\n- 50 Ω GCPW traces \n- LC impedance matching on antenna ports 2 & 4\n- MMCX interface to Ebyte carrier board (UHF transceiver board)\n\nGPS L1 - 1575.42 MHz\n\n- GPS patch antenna with SMA interface\n- 50 Ω GCPW traces \n\nPower Transfer\n\n- USB-C PD input for external power during testing/charging\n- Charges the BMS board conected through JST connector\n\nAntenna Deployment\n\n- MOSFET-controlled burn-wire circuit\n- Signal comes from connection to FC board\n\nPCB & Mechanical Design\n\n- 6-layer JLC06161H-3313 stackup\n- Top-face CubeSat mounting and external hardware interfaces. Covers (+) Z face"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
